Package: halfBaked
Title: Half-baked Convenience Functions For Common `Omics Analyses
Version: 0.99.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jared", "Andrews", , "jared.andrews07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0780-6248"))
Description: halfBaked is a collection of convenience functions to aid in `omics analyses.
    They span functions to automate and organize repetitive analyses (e.g. many pairwise RNA-seq comparisons) to viz.
    More specifically, they’re designed to help create template Rmd notebooks to jumpstart exploratory data analysis and get the ball rolling for common data modalities.
    Several templates are provided as vignettes.
